# type: short imperative subject in lowercase (feat, fix, docs, chore, ci, perf, refactor, test)
#
# Body: explain why, not what. Wrap at 72 columns. Plain hyphens only,
# no em or en dashes anywhere in the message.
#
# No attribution trailers of any kind (Co-Authored-By, Generated-with,
# tool or assistant mentions). The commit speaks for the change alone.
